data: {"id": "2b0d47b64aeb4167-thinking-parallel_evidence-1244", "run_id": "2b0d47b64aeb4167", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实与冲突\n\n### Kubernetes 状态（kubectl_describe）\n- **Pod 状态**: `Running`，但容器 `app` 处于 **Waiting: CrashLoopBackOff**，`Ready=False`。\n- **重启计数**: `13` 次。\n- **最近一次终态**: Terminated, **Exit Code 1** (Started: 14:54:45, Finished: 14:54:54，仅存活约 9 秒)。\n- **容器命令**: `python3 -u -c \"from pathlib import Path; print(Path('/input/app.conf').read_text())\"`\n- **Volume**: `/input` 挂载为 **EmptyDir**（空目录）。\n- **事件**: `Warning BackOff x202 over 47m` — kubelet 反复尝试重启并 BackOff。\n- **节点**: node2/10.2.0.50，**没有 Owner Refere", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789138775286, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

