data: {"id": "2b0d47b64aeb4167-final", "run_id": "2b0d47b64aeb4167", "seq": 1249, "ts_ms": 1789138791865, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v09/workload` | CrashLoopBackOff | workload in CrashLoopBackOff |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `Warning BackOff restarting failed container app in pod workload_aiops-case-v09(5746c496-b67c-4906-aabb-e71359674305)` | 直接描述崩溃循环现象 |\n| 2 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `last_terminated_reason: Error`, `last_exit_code: 1` | 确认容器异常退出机制 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | Kubernetes | `memory_request: 8Mi`, `memory_limit: 32Mi`, `cpu_request: 5m`, `cpu_limit: 50m` | 确认资源配额充足且合理 |\n| 4 | Logging | Elasticsearch | `FileNotFoundError: [Errno 2] No such file or directory: '/input/app.conf'` | 揭示容器启动崩溃的具体原因 |\n| 5 | Logging | Elasticsearch | `print(Path('/input/app.conf').read_text())` | 证明导致崩溃的代码行为 |\n| 6 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason=1` (reason: CrashLoopBackOff) | 从监控维度印证 Pod 等待重启状态 |\n| 7 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total=13` | 佐证该容器已被重启多次 |\n\n**证据关联说明：**\n- 证据 1、2、6 共同指向 Pod 因异常退出而陷入 CrashLoopBackOff 状态。\n- 证据 4 与 5 构成了因果链条中的核心环节，直接证明了 Python 脚本在执行 `Path('/input/app.conf').read_text()` 时因文件缺失而抛出异常。\n- 证据 3 确认了内存和 CPU 限制并非导致崩溃的因素，排除了资源限制的可能。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n```text\nEmptyDir 卷中缺少 '/input/app.conf' 文件 → Python 启动脚本执行 read_text 抛出 FileNotFoundError → 容器进程终止并退出码 1 → kubelet 触发 CrashLoopBackOff 循环重启\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n已确认的根因为：**容器启动命令依赖的文件 `/input/app.conf` 不存在于挂载的 EmptyDir 卷中**。\n\n日志中的 `FileNotFoundError` (证据 4) 直接印证了启动脚本 (证据 5) 因无法读取配置文件而崩溃，进而导致 Kubernetes 报告 `CrashLoopBackOff` (证据 1、6) 和异常退出 (证据 2)。监控数据 (证据 7) 进一步确认了容器已重启 13 次。现有证据链完整，足以解释该组异常的全部现象。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 53.2s\n├─ 问题定位: 9.6s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 34.4s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v09/workload: 34.4s (Evidence 27.1s, RCA 7.2s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 9.2s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- 未调用 Runbook\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 53.199, "metrics": {"run_id": "2b0d47b64aeb4167", "mttr": {"value": "53.2s", "seconds": 53.19781851768494, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "32%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": false, "runbook_id": null, "pass": false, "score": 0.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.045, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "未匹配"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 53197.81851768494, "llm_calls": 9, "llm_duration_ms": 50563.16041946411, "tool_calls": 7, "executed_tool_calls": 7, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 7, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 5243.813037872314, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 2303.6439418792725}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 9595.872163772583, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集